   186	    generators + search/extract + think. Excludes shell*, browser, preview_*,
   187	    server_status, submit_plan, plan_step, code_exec, file_str_replace,
   188	    delegate_explore. The INTERACTIVE/NeverConfirm loop is low-risk by design;
