   262	class DefaultToolExecutor:
   263	    """[CONTRACT behavior; INTERIOR code] The concrete `ToolExecutor`.
   264	
   265	    The context is built internally from injected pieces (sandbox, capability
   266	    broker, ownership) rather than a free `ctx_factory` — an [INTERIOR] choice;
   267	    the §4 illustrative `ctx_factory` is one way to spell the same thing.
   268	    """
