    14	1. Create the app from the lead-gen starting point.
    15	2. Fill real content (no fake testimonials/stats — use placeholders + media slots).
    16	3. Wire the lead form so a submission persists; confirm it shows in the admin view.
    17	4. preview_start → ready_for_app_verification (strict).
    18	5. Export the Cloudflare project + handoff package.
